[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Stratford-on-Avon, as we all know, has only one industry—William Shakespeare—but there are two distinctly separate and increasingly hostile branches.",
    "translation": "众所周知，埃文河畔斯特拉特福只有一个行业——威廉·莎士比亚——但有两个截然不同且日益敌对的行业。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "There is the Royal Shakespeare Company (RSC), which presents superb productions of the plays at the Shakespeare Memorial Theatre on the Avon.",
    "translation": "皇家莎士比亚剧团 (RSC) 在埃文河畔的莎士比亚纪念剧院上演精彩的戏剧作品。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "And there are the townsfolk who largely live off the tourists who come, not to see the plays, but to look at Anne Hathaway's Cottage, Shakespeare's birthplace and the other sights.",
    "translation": "还有一些镇民主要依靠游客为生，游客来不是为了看戏剧，而是为了参观安妮海瑟薇的小屋、莎士比亚的出生地和其他景点。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "The worthy residents of Stratford doubt that the theater adds a penny to their revenue.",
    "translation": "斯特拉特福的值得尊敬的居民怀疑剧院是否会给他们增加一分钱的收入。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "They frankly dislike the RSC's actors, them with their long hair and beards and sandals and noisiness.",
    "translation": "坦率地说，他们不喜欢皇家莎士比亚剧团的演员，他们留着长发、胡须、穿着凉鞋，而且吵闹。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "It's all deliciously ironic when you consider that Shakespeare, who earns their living, was himself an actor (with a beard) and did his share of noise-making.",
    "translation": "当你想到以谋生为生的莎士比亚本人也是一名演员（留着胡子）并做了他的那份制造噪音的事情时，这一切都是非常讽刺的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The tourist streams are not entirely separate.",
    "translation": "旅游流并不是完全分开的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The sightseers who come by bus—and often take in Warwick Castle and Blenheim Palace on the side—don't usually see the plays, and some of them are even surprised to find a theatre in Stratford.",
    "translation": "乘坐巴士前来的观光客——经常顺便参观沃里克城堡和布莱尼姆宫——通常看不到戏剧，其中一些人甚至惊讶地发现斯特拉特福有一座剧院。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "However, the playgoers do manage a little sight-seeing along with their playgoing.",
    "translation": "然而，观众们在观看比赛的同时也确实进行了一些观光活动。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "It is the playgoers, the RSC contends, who bring in much of the town's revenue because they spend the night (some of them four or five nights) pouring cash into the hotels and restaurants.",
    "translation": "RSC 认为，正是游客带来了该镇的大部分收入，因为他们在酒店和餐馆过夜（有些是四到五晚），将现金投入其中。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The sightseers can take in everything and get out of town by nightfall.",
    "translation": "观光者可以参观一切，并在夜幕降临时离开城镇。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The townsfolk don't see it this way and the local council does not contribute directly to the subsidy of the Royal Shakespeare Company.",
    "translation": "镇民并不这么认为，地方议会也不直接为皇家莎士比亚剧团提供补贴。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Stratford cries poor traditionally.",
    "translation": "斯特拉特福传统上哭穷。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Nevertheless every hotel in town seems to be adding a new wing or cocktail lounge.",
    "translation": "尽管如此，城里的每家酒店似乎都在增加一个新的翼楼或鸡尾酒廊。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Hilton is building its own hotel there, which you may be sure will be decorated with Hamlet Hamburger Bars, the Lear Lounge, the Banquo Banqueting Room, and so forth, and will be very expensive.",
    "translation": "希尔顿正在那里建造自己的酒店，您可以肯定，酒店将装饰有哈姆雷特汉堡酒吧、李尔酒廊、班柯宴会厅等，而且价格非常昂贵。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Anyway, the townsfolk can't understand why the Royal Shakespeare Company needs a subsidy. (The theatre has broken attendance records for three years in a row.",
    "translation": "无论如何，镇民们无法理解为什么皇家莎士比亚剧团需要补贴。 （剧院连续三年打破上座率记录。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Last year its 1,431 seats were 94 per cent occupied all year long and this year they'll do better.) The reason, of course, is that costs have rocketed and ticket prices have stayed low.",
    "translation": "去年，它的 1,431 个座位全年都有 94% 的上座率，今年会做得更好。）当然，原因是成本飙升，而票价却保持在较低水平。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P3-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P3-S6",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "It would be a shame to raise prices too much because it would drive away the young people who are Stratford's most attractive clientele.",
    "translation": "价格提得太高将是一种耻辱，因为这会赶走斯特拉特福最有吸引力的客户群年轻人。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P3-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P3-S7",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "They come entirely for the plays, not the sights.",
    "translation": "他们完全是为了看戏，而不是为了看风景。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2006.js",
      "year": 2006,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2006-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:dae9dbb471cf116cef828c941e47f18acef37c8c20398cd3fd6bb0126f995932"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
